---
/* Cream-toned footer (NOT dark) — per DESIGN.md */
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>카테고리</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/posts?category=reading">독서</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts?category=study">공부</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts?category=reflection">성찰</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts?category=essay">에세이</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>탐구</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/about">소개</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts">전체 글</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>영감</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://eckharttolle.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">에크하르트 톨레</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>프로젝트</h3>
        <p class="footer-about">에크하르트 톨레의 'A New Earth'에서 영감받은 자기 탐구 블로그입니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>&copy; 2026 presence · ego</p>
      <p class="footer-quote">"당신은 생각이 아닙니다. 당신은 생각을 알아차리는 존재입니다."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-soft);
    padding: 80px 0 var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xxl);
  }
  .footer-col h3 {
    font: var(--text-title-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .footer-col ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
  }
  .footer-col a {
    font: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); }
  .footer-about {
    font: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .footer-bottom p {
    font: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted-soft);
  }
  .footer-quote {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
